[al:RAZ 分级教材（E）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:All Kinds of Musical Instruments]

[00:00.05]Leveled book E|分级教材 E
[00:01.76]All Kinds of Musical Instruments.|各种乐器。
[00:04.78]Written by Sarah Ghusson.|作者：Sarah Ghusson。
[00:07.06]Focus Question: What are some different ways to play musical instruments?|重点问题：演奏乐器有哪些不同的方式？
[00:12.90]Words to know.|关键词。
[00:14.32]Bow.|弓。
[00:15.18]Music.|音乐。
[00:16.35]Buzz.|嗡嗡声。
[00:17.25]Sounds.|声音。
[00:18.51]Instruments.|乐器。
[00:20.01]Strings.|弦乐器。
[00:21.28]There are four main groups of instruments.|乐器主要分为四大类。
[00:24.26]There are many kinds of instruments in each group.|每类中都有许多种乐器。
[00:27.79]These instruments use strings to make sounds.|这些乐器利用弦来发声。
[00:31.23]Use a bow or your fingers to play them.|使用弓或手指演奏它们。
[00:34.35]These instruments use air from your mouth to make sounds.|这些乐器利用口中的空气发声。
[00:38.62]Blow into them to play them.|吹气演奏它们。
[00:40.98]These instruments use moving air and lips to make sounds.|这些乐器利用流动的空气和嘴唇发声。
[00:45.37]Make your lips buzz to play them.|让嘴唇振动来演奏它们。
[00:47.99]These instruments use sticks or hands to make sounds.|这些乐器使用棍棒或手来发声。
[00:52.12]Hit them to play them.|敲击它们进行演奏。
[00:54.09]You can play instruments to make music!|你可以演奏乐器来创作音乐！
